=2 Walkthrough
* After registering with the {p:Pioneers' Coalition}, zone and wait for a game day change before returning to the {p:Pioneers' Coalition} for a cutscene.
* Proceed to the eastern half of (G-8) in {z:Ceizak Battlegrounds} and click the **Earthen Mound** for another cutscene.
** Located just south of Bivouac #2

!EarthernMound.png||
* Head southwest to (E-10) and enter the {z:Sih Gates}.
* Once inside, head west to (E-6) and click on the **Foreboding Presence** for another cutscene.
* Click on it again to spawn the NM {m:Fomor Pioneer}.
** Trusts make this fight trivial for solo players
*** The NM may cast Cure IV / Cure V on players / pets occasionally, healing them for ~600 HP.
*** Fomor Pioneer is highly evasive and has approximately 10,000 HP.

* Click on the **Foreboding Presence** one last time after defeating the NM for another cutscene and the {@k} {k:Reive unity} Key Item.
* Head back to the {p:Pioneers' Coalition} for another Cutscene and reward.

